    "description": "A.T. Cross & Manuscript\nGold Tone Writing Set and Calligraphy Fountain Pen\nGold-filled and Anodized Metal\n7\" x 3\" x 1\" (Case)\nMaker marked\nThis lot includes a vintage A.T. Cross gold-filled pen and mechanical pencil set alongside a contemporary Manuscript calligraphy fountain pen. The Cross set features the brand's iconic engine-turned pinstripe finish and black conical tops, housed in a velvet-lined presentation case. The Manuscript pen offers a modern contrast with a vibrant lime green matte finish and a knurled grip designed for precise calligraphy work. Both sets represent quality craftsmanship in writing instrument design.\nCross set features 10K gold-filled barrels with hallmark branding on clips\nManuscript pen includes a textured knurled grip and original metal tin\nCollection includes two distinct writing styles for various applications\nCondition:\nGood pre-owned condition. Cross instruments show light surface swirling and minor marks consistent with age and use. Manuscript pen has minor ink residue on the nib. Cases show light storage wear to the exterior.\nThank you for all of your support!",
